        ],
        "en": [
          "Ponchon tiles, the flagship product of Isère ceramic production from the late 19th century to the 1920s, remain a living heritage! Traditional blue motifs on a white background enliven hand-decorated and made-to-order tiles and tableware.\nObjects happy to serve, decorative and utilitarian pieces inspired by the observation of nature.\nUnique pieces combining stoneware and turned wood. Open by appointment."
        ],
        "it": [
